and ${\rm RelBias}\le b$ is $\mu^{2}\ge b^{-1}$ on the first order Nagar
scale.  The $1-\alpha$ requirement ${\rm RelBias}\le b$ with the lower
bound is therefore

\begin{equation*}
\sqrt{F}-z_{1-\alpha}\ge\sqrt{b^{-1}},\qquad 
